ility of frontline health and education workers; Improved deployment and retention of teachers and healthcare workers in underserved areas • Results Area 2 - Policy Reforms for Sustainable Wage Bill Framework. This results area supports a coordinated reform of career management and compensation to address structural weaknesses that undermine merit-based human resource management and contribute to wage bill pressures. • Results Area 3 - Strengthen public financial management. This results area seeks to support fiscal discipline and transparency in public wage bill management by capping nominal wage bill growth, requiring granular disaggregation of personnel costs in government budget documents, and use of a medium-term fiscal framework for wage bill planning. Improved debt recording and transparency, and reduction in debt service arrears; Government cash balances consolidated into the Treasury Single Account; and Public procurement is conducted through the e-GP system using competitive tendering .","url":"https://projects.worldbank.org/en/projects-operations/project-detail/P514896","theme":"Health & education","climate":false},{"id":"P516432","name":"Third Cabo Verde Disaster Risk Management Development Policy Loan with a Cat DDO","country":{"slug":"cabo-verde","name":"Cabo Verde","iso":"CV","region":"West Africa","currency":"CVE","sectors":["Tourism","Services"]},"status":"Pipeline","approvalDate":"2026-10-29","amountUsd":20000000,"abstract":"","url":"https://projects.worldbank.org/en/projects-operations/project-detail/P516432","theme":"Finance & fiscal","climate":false},{"id":"P515428","name":"Solar Energy and Access Project","country":{"slug":"burkina-faso","name":"Burkina Faso","iso":"BF","region":"West Africa","currency":"XOF","sectors":["Gold","Agriculture"]},"status":"Pipeline","approvalDate":"2026-10-30","amountUsd":130000000,"abstract":"","url":"https://projects.worldbank.org/en/projects-operations/project-detail/P515428","theme":"Climate & energy","climate"